  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.03,
      "end_seconds": 3.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Right, thanks for waiting, come in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.91,
      "end_seconds": 10.07,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "hi doctor I got here as fast as I could"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 10.92,
      "end_seconds": 17.36,
      "duration_seconds": 6.44,
      "text": "Sorry um what was I saying doctor thank you for seeing us."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.91,
      "end_seconds": 26.16,
      "duration_seconds": 7.25,
      "text": "So, of course, please stay. It's helpful to have you here. So what can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.18,
      "end_seconds": 34.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.73,
      "text": "It's refusing food, mostly. It's the not knowing that gets to me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.35,
      "end_seconds": 39.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "What do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.26,
      "end_seconds": 48.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "I take something called alen... alendronate 70 milligrams maybe once a week for my bones"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.01,
      "end_seconds": 53.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Is the packet here or the prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.38,
      "end_seconds": 62.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "not with me. I'll bring it next time. Foracort inhaler, twice a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.12,
      "end_seconds": 66.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "how long has it it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.09,
      "end_seconds": 71.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "around three weeks, uh, I think"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 72.64,
      "end_seconds": 78.66,
      "duration_seconds": 6.02,
      "text": "let me think, I think it's been nearer a month, actually"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.68,
      "end_seconds": 84.78,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Okay so roughly three to four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.52,
      "end_seconds": 89.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "that sounds about right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.71,
      "end_seconds": 95.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Is it it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.39,
      "end_seconds": 103.14,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Um, I'd give it a six, out of ten."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.78,
      "end_seconds": 105.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.66,
      "end_seconds": 127.94,
      "duration_seconds": 21.28,
      "text": "When it starts I tend to get seen putting a coin-like object in his mouth as well. As for little drooling, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.54,
      "end_seconds": 131.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.31,
      "end_seconds": 145.81,
      "duration_seconds": 12.5,
      "text": "Pretty moderate, if I'm being honest. And, And a mild cough, too. As for seen putting a coin-like object in his mouth, mild, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.39,
      "end_seconds": 149.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Did you get breathing difficulty or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.27,
      "end_seconds": 154.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "I haven't had breathing difficulty or fever, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.7,
      "end_seconds": 159.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Did you get vomiting blood or rash?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.63,
      "end_seconds": 166.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "no vomiting blood or rash, none of it"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.59,
      "end_seconds": 173.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Okay, have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.45,
      "end_seconds": 177.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "no, that's all normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.56,
      "end_seconds": 181.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "and and your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.29,
      "end_seconds": 183.47,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.62,
      "end_seconds": 202.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.11,
      "end_seconds": 206.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "No not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.71,
      "end_seconds": 209.98,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 210.84,
      "end_seconds": 216.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "just a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.41,
      "end_seconds": 219.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "text": "do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.13,
      "end_seconds": 223.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.2,
      "text": "I only drink at family occasions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.14,
      "end_seconds": 226.06,
      "duration_seconds": 0.92,
      "text": "any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.12,
      "end_seconds": 231.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "I have about eight cigarettes in a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.8,
      "end_seconds": 234.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.74,
      "end_seconds": 239.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.4,
      "end_seconds": 242.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Do you get out much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.93,
      "end_seconds": 248.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.44,
      "text": "Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.91,
      "end_seconds": 251.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.85,
      "text": "how are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 252.74,
      "end_seconds": 256.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.18,
      "end_seconds": 274.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.95,
      "end_seconds": 278.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "I have thin bones."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.55,
      "end_seconds": 282.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "right, and anything else to add?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 282.79,
      "end_seconds": 285.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "I've I've got asthma."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 286.43,
      "end_seconds": 293.02,
      "duration_seconds": 6.59,
      "text": "yes, carry on. Okay, I can see thin bones and asthma in your file as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 300.64,
      "end_seconds": 303.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "let's start with the the basic checks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.18,
      "end_seconds": 320.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "keep your arm relaxed for me.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.37,
      "end_seconds": 343.44,
      "duration_seconds": 6.07,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 67 temperature is 36.4 degrees BP is 125 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.82,
      "end_seconds": 350.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 351.61,
      "end_seconds": 353.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "tell me if that's sore"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.02,
      "end_seconds": 374.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "he is playful, breathing normally and the throat looks normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.14,
      "end_seconds": 394.88,
      "duration_seconds": 14.74,
      "text": "thank you, you can get dressed. Taking everything into account, I'd lean towards a possible swallowed button battery needing an urgent X-ray despite few symptoms. We shouldn't forget a swallowed coin"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 395.89,
      "end_seconds": 399.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 400.42,
      "end_seconds": 424.34,
      "duration_seconds": 23.92,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a possible swallowed button battery needing an urgent X-ray despite few symptoms, and we'll know more once the an urgent chest and abdominal X-ray is back. I'm going to order an urgent chest and abdominal X-ray, for possible battery ingestion"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 425.15,
      "end_seconds": 428.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Is that that done today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 430.2,
      "end_seconds": 461.31,
      "duration_seconds": 31.11,
      "text": "a button battery can burn the gullet within hours even when a child looks well, so we scan now. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency. I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 461.96,
      "end_seconds": 466.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "let me think, great, thank you for your help"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 468.49,
      "end_seconds": 469.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}